      "title": "Adding support for time relative to capture start",
      "message": "Adding support for time relative to capture start\n\nThis patch allows to show time relative to capture start in the packet\ndetails.\n\nCurrently only the BLF format uses this.\n",
      "author_name": "Dr. Lars Völker",
      "author_email": "lars.voelker@technica-engineering.de",
